    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Israeli gooyuuk fih",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba diktam ea damwalah bea gheambalmeeda Asa, ghang'eat sugoocheanda Israeli siguura Baasha ak gawa gang'uchi Yuda, hean ng'ata ghwadeas Rama, ea mudu gwanda siichea gwarita gawa heeda Asaheeda was sugoocheanda Yuda ghana ghwahidu jih heeda mida niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageana Asa jeeda gheaseeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gheeda sugoocheanda, lapiya ea dahaabu ak gweasa sugoocheanda siguura Ben-hadadi bea Shaamu aba Dameski, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nung' gwanda neajeeda dageascheedeanya, gawuurji gidaghayi sin ghweandeanyu ea daang'u, ak ging'ulayi, neajeakneey lapiya ea dahaabu; asi una ak gilaji neajeadaang'u sea Baasha was sugoocheanda Israeli, ak abeeda gayghang'amwanaani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gooleeysiit Ben-hadadi sugoocheanda was Asa, ng'ata goojeakta fuga miineadayiisa shirikareadaanyi gang'uchi mujiinajeega Israeli; ak hean ghaghas Ijoni, ea Dani, ea Abel-maimu, ea mujiinajeega sean bea gheaseeniga Naftali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayiiy Baasha ng'asheanji, ak ghwanung'waada deekshooda Rama, ghwanung' ghamiinaada gadiyoojigaaschi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghaghas sugoocheanda was Asa fuga sean Yuda; ng'ata gageanda eara lagheanga Rama ea geedigaaschi, was gea ghayi deakta Baasha, ama ng'ata ghwadeasa Geba ea Mispa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sibaneeda siguura Hanani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba damandida ghwaan Hananeeda was meang'nyeanda heeda Asa was sugoocheanda Yuda, ak gwayeesha, “Aba gideaba ang'iing'i nibwati sugoocheanda Shaamu, nea ea miibwata NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, hean ea nimng'awaneey shirikareeda Shaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ea mii fuga Gushi sea fuga Libya bea shirikareeda saang'a mideawa mutukwajeega ea fuga ding'da faraasajeega? Aba gideaba ang'iing'i gibwati NG'UTAMIIDA niny ea niihaak geatingaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gheanyanga NG'UTAMIIDA inyeesa gang'ula bwadaw ea mwadi aba jeeda ng'eanyiida sean, ghoahiimu uurdaanyi aba badahuuka fuga doobiiweadi aba headaanyi. Ang'iing'i nisini leendeeda aba ng'asheanji; aba gideaba gidang'eada ghamneawa gaynyasa ng'ucheeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoanyareas Asa meang'nyeandida, ng'ata gwajaksa jeeda gheeda ghealooniga, aba gideaba ghoanyareas ng'asheandida. Hean ghoang'eat Asa aba damandida sawanda fuga mwaatkwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Huuydeanda gheambalmeeda Asa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gadiyoojiga Asa bea gidang'eada madeeda ea gagul huuydeanda geeng'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda sugoodiga Yuda ea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba diktam ea damashageash bea gheambalmeeda Asa ghang'ut geeshtaanyi geeyooda, hean gwaheedu muuchi geeyoadaanyi, nea eara iiheedu geeyoadaanyi ea magaseada NG'UTAMIIDA, niny gagasa weeta aba heeda meanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghami Asa ak geebung'sa murdeeda ghweanigaaschi, hean geebuy gweaydeaba haradam ea agi bea gheambalmeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geebung'sa jeeda shoomanda ghayi gurgursa geaw aba jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi. Ng'ata geewiilsa badayda bulaliida goola eayiin nagheeda ng'andidi ghayi sin gearnoodiga; hean ghaghwar beasta haw aba murdeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
